  "description": "CONVERSION OF SINGLE DWELLINGHOUSE  INTO 3 x SELF-CONTAINED  FLATS. ERECTION OF PART SINGLE/PART TWO STOREY REAR EXTENSION AND ASSOCIATED WORKS. ",
